-- ============================================================================
-- Arcadia Editions Modulith: scenario test data for place-order-flow
-- Regenerate with the zenwave-test-scenarios skill (DDL: target/ddl/schema.sql, exported 2026-11-12).
-- Values are identical in src/test/resources/data/jpa/<Entity>/<n>.json (n = row order, id = 1 + (n-1)*50).
-- Fixed test "now": 2026-10-01T12:00:00Z. Tests must read it through a fixed java.time.Clock
--   (the project has no injected Clock yet: a board task adds it).
--
-- SCENARIO MATRIX: chain | business ids | state per aggregate | point of the flow | used by
-- C-01 | ORD-001, CUST-001 | Order CREATED, StockReservation RESERVED x1, Payment AUTHORIZATION_REQUESTED (attempt 1) | OrderCreated handled, authorization pending, inside the window | authorizePayment redelivery (payment exists); voidPayment from AUTHORIZATION_REQUESTED; timer before deadline; getOrder CREATED
-- C-02 | ORD-002, CUST-002 | Order CREATED, StockReservation RESERVED x2, Payment AUTHORIZED (attempt 1) | PaymentAuthorized emitted, confirmOrder pending; 2 lines | confirmOrder from CREATED; confirmStockReservation from RESERVED (several reservations per order)
-- C-03 | ORD-003, CUST-003 | Order CONFIRMED, StockReservation CONFIRMED x1, Payment AUTHORIZED (attempt 1) | OrderConfirmed emitted, scheduleFulfillment pending | scheduleFulfillment; confirmOrder/confirmStockReservation redelivery (already CONFIRMED); getOrder CONFIRMED
-- C-04 | ORD-004, CUST-004 | Order CONFIRMED, StockReservation CONFIRMED x1, Payment AUTHORIZED (attempt 1), Fulfillment SCHEDULED | FulfillmentScheduled emitted, capturePayment pending | capturePayment from AUTHORIZED; scheduleFulfillment redelivery; markReadyToShip from SCHEDULED
-- C-05 | ORD-005, CUST-005 | Order CONFIRMED, StockReservation CONFIRMED x1, Payment CAPTURED (attempt 1), Fulfillment SCHEDULED | PaymentCaptured emitted, sendOrderConfirmation pending | sendOrderConfirmation; capturePayment redelivery (already CAPTURED)
-- C-06 | ORD-006, CUST-006 | Order CONFIRMED, StockReservation CONFIRMED x1, Payment CAPTURED (attempt 1), Fulfillment READY_TO_SHIP, Notification ORDER_CONFIRMATION SENT | end completed (OrderConfirmationSent); fulfillment later marked ready to ship | flow outcome completed; sendOrderConfirmation redelivery; fulfillment READY_TO_SHIP read side
-- C-07 | ORD-007, CUST-007 | Notification STOCK_UNAVAILABLE SENT | end stockGone (StockUnavailableNotificationSent); no order, reservation or payment (off-chain notification) | flow outcome stockGone; reserveStock UNAVAILABLE (SKU-003 position, available 0); sendStockUnavailableNotification redelivery
-- C-08 | ORD-008, CUST-008 | Order CANCELLED, StockReservation RELEASED x1, Payment DECLINED (attempt 1), Notification ORDER_CANCELLED SENT | end orderCancelled, cause payment declined | flow outcome orderCancelled/declined; getOrder CANCELLED; cancelOrder/releaseStock redelivery
-- C-09 | ORD-009, CUST-009 | Order CANCELLED, StockReservation RELEASED x1, Payment RETRY_EXHAUSTED (attempt 3), Notification ORDER_CANCELLED SENT | end orderCancelled, cause retries exhausted | flow outcome orderCancelled/retry-exhausted
-- C-10 | ORD-010, CUST-010 | Order CANCELLED, StockReservation RELEASED x1, Payment VOIDED (attempt 1), Fulfillment FAILED, Notification ORDER_CANCELLED SENT | end orderCancelled, cause fulfillment failed and authorization voided | flow outcome orderCancelled/voided; voidPayment redelivery (already VOIDED)
-- C-11 | ORD-011, CUST-011 | Order CANCELLED, StockReservation RELEASED x1, Payment AUTHORIZATION_REQUESTED (attempt 1), Notification ORDER_CANCELLED SENT | end orderCancelled, cause reservation expired (payment stalled) | flow outcome orderCancelled/expired; timer redelivery (already RELEASED)
-- C-12 | ORD-012, CUST-012 | Order CREATED, StockReservation RESERVED x1, Payment FAILED (attempt 1) | PaymentFailed emitted (attempt 1 of 3), retryPayment pending | retryPayment retried (below limit); voidPayment from FAILED
-- C-13 | ORD-013, CUST-013 | Order CREATED, StockReservation RESERVED x1, Payment FAILED (attempt 3) | PaymentFailed emitted at the retry limit, retryPayment pending | retryPayment retry-exhausted (attemptCount = limit)
-- C-14 | ORD-014, CUST-014 | Order CREATED, StockReservation RESERVED x1, Payment FAILED (attempt 2) | reservation past its deadline, payment unresolved: ReservationExpired due | timer: releaseStock RESERVATION_EXPIRED from RESERVED (past deadline)
-- C-15 | ORD-015, CUST-015 | Order CREATED, StockReservation RESERVED x1, Payment DECLINED (attempt 1) | PaymentDeclined emitted, releaseStock pending | releaseStock PAYMENT_DECLINED from RESERVED
-- C-16 | ORD-016, CUST-016 | Order CONFIRMED, StockReservation CONFIRMED x1, Payment AUTHORIZED (attempt 1), Fulfillment FAILED | FulfillmentFailed emitted, voidPayment pending | voidPayment from AUTHORIZED (FulfillmentFailed listener)
-- C-17 | ORD-017, CUST-017 | Order CONFIRMED, StockReservation CONFIRMED x1, Payment CAPTURE_FAILED (attempt 1), Fulfillment SCHEDULED | PaymentCaptureFailed emitted, voidPayment pending | voidPayment from CAPTURE_FAILED (PaymentCaptureFailed listener)
-- C-18 | ORD-018, CUST-018 | Order CONFIRMED, StockReservation CONFIRMED x1, Payment VOIDED (attempt 1), Fulfillment FAILED | PaymentVoided emitted, releaseStock pending | releaseStock PAYMENT_VOIDED from CONFIRMED
-- C-19 | ORD-019, CUST-019 | Order CREATED, StockReservation RELEASED x1, Payment DECLINED (attempt 1) | StockReleased emitted (declined), cancelOrder pending | cancelOrder from CREATED
-- C-20 | ORD-020, CUST-020 | Order CONFIRMED, StockReservation RELEASED x1, Payment VOIDED (attempt 1), Fulfillment FAILED | StockReleased emitted (voided), cancelOrder pending | cancelOrder from CONFIRMED
-- C-21 | ORD-021, CUST-021 | Order CANCELLED, StockReservation RELEASED x1, Payment DECLINED (attempt 1) | OrderCancelled emitted, sendOrderCancelledNotification pending | sendOrderCancelledNotification
-- (off-chain) products SKU-001..SKU-005 and inventory positions SKU-001..SKU-003: catalog/backoffice, keyed by sku
--
-- COVERAGE MATRIX: need -> chain/row (or why no row)
-- inventory reserveStock (new) enough stock -> SKU-001/SKU-002 positions
-- inventory reserveStock UNAVAILABLE -> SKU-003 position (available 0), C-07
-- inventory reserveStock several lines -> C-02
-- inventory confirmStockReservation from RESERVED -> C-02
-- inventory releaseStock from RESERVED (declined) -> C-15
-- inventory releaseStock from RESERVED (expired, timer past deadline) -> C-14
-- inventory releaseStock from RESERVED (retry exhausted) -> C-13 after retry (no stored row needed beyond C-13)
-- inventory releaseStock from CONFIRMED (voided) -> C-18
-- inventory timer before deadline (no release) -> C-01
-- inventory redelivery confirm/release -> C-03 / C-08, C-11
-- backoffice createInventoryPosition (sku without position) -> SKU-004 product, no position
-- backoffice receiveStock / adjustStock -> SKU-001 position
-- orders startOrderCheckout (new) -> no row: input only; uses SKU-001 position
-- orders confirmOrder from CREATED -> C-02
-- orders cancelOrder from CREATED -> C-19
-- orders cancelOrder from CONFIRMED -> C-20
-- orders getOrder CREATED / CONFIRMED / CANCELLED -> C-01 / C-03 / C-08
-- payments authorizePayment (new) -> no row: OrderCreated input
-- payments authorizePayment authorized/declined/failed -> stub-driven (provider decides)
-- payments authorizePayment redelivery -> C-01
-- payments retryPayment from FAILED below limit -> C-12
-- payments retryPayment from FAILED at limit -> C-13
-- payments authorizePayment from PaymentRetried -> C-12 (P-01 accepted D: reuse the FAILED Payment, it holds amount/currency/email/paymentMethodId)
-- payments capturePayment from AUTHORIZED -> C-04 (AUTHORIZED is target of no @transition: P-02)
-- payments capturePayment captured/capture-failed -> stub-driven
-- payments capturePayment redelivery -> C-05
-- payments voidPayment from AUTHORIZED / AUTHORIZATION_REQUESTED / FAILED / CAPTURE_FAILED -> C-16 / C-01 / C-12 / C-17
-- payments voidPayment redelivery -> C-10
-- fulfillment scheduleFulfillment (new) -> C-03 (OrderConfirmed, no fulfillment yet)
-- fulfillment scheduleFulfillment scheduled/failed -> stub-driven (warehouse decides)
-- fulfillment scheduleFulfillment redelivery -> C-04
-- fulfillment markReadyToShip from SCHEDULED -> C-04
-- fulfillment read side READY_TO_SHIP / FAILED -> C-06 / C-16
-- notifications sendOrderConfirmation -> C-05; redelivery C-06
-- notifications sendStockUnavailableNotification -> input only; redelivery C-07
-- notifications sendOrderCancelledNotification -> C-21; redelivery C-08
-- notifications NotificationDeliveryFailed -> stub-driven (e-mail provider)
-- products updateProduct from DRAFT / PUBLISHED -> SKU-004 / SKU-001
-- products publishProduct from DRAFT -> SKU-004
-- products retireProduct from DRAFT / PUBLISHED -> SKU-004 / SKU-002
-- products read side RETIRED -> SKU-005
-- flow outcomes completed / stockGone / orderCancelled x4 causes -> C-06 / C-07 / C-08, C-09, C-10, C-11
--
-- ASSUMPTIONS: id | value used | open question
-- A-01 | status after each outcome of authorizePayment / capturePayment / scheduleFulfillment / send* = the enum value named after the outcome event (PaymentAuthorized -> AUTHORIZED, FulfillmentFailed -> FAILED, ...Sent -> SENT) | P-02
-- A-02 | stock counters: reserve moves available->reserved, confirm reserved->sold, release returns reserved (or sold) to available; reserved = sum of RESERVED rows; sold = sum of CONFIRMED rows + sales before the fixtures (SKU-003: 10) | none in the models
-- A-03 | payment retry limit = 3 attempts (attemptCount = limit -> retryPayment emits PaymentRetryExhausted) | none in the models
-- A-04 | reservation window = 10 minutes: expiresAt = reservedAt + 10m (ZFL @time) | place-order-flow.zfl @time
-- A-05 | StockUnavailable creates no Order, StockReservation or Payment row (ZFL: "no order record was created") | ZDL startOrderCheckout returns Order @transition(to: CREATED)
-- A-06 | Payment.failureReason / Fulfillment.failureReason codes: card_declined, processor_timeout, capture_window_closed, fulfillment_failed, warehouse_damage | none in the models
-- A-07 | cancellationReason = StockReleased.reason (StockReleaseReason name) | orders-checkout CancelOrderInput.reason doc
-- A-08 | a released reservation keeps confirmedAt when it was CONFIRMED before (voided after fulfillment) | none
-- ============================================================================

